xref: Wikipedia:DNA_damage_checkpoint
xref: Wikipedia:Postreplication_checkpoint
is_a: GO:0031570 ! DNA integrity checkpoint signaling
is_a: GO:0042770 ! signal transduction in response to DNA damage

