[Term]
id: GO:0005801
name: cis-Golgi network
namespace: cellular_component
def: "The network of interconnected tubular and cisternal structures located at the convex side of the Golgi apparatus, which abuts the endoplasmic reticulum." [ISBN:0198506732, ISBN:0815316194, PMID:23543640, PMID:9695800]
comment: The CGN is not considered part of the Golgi stack.
