synonym: "bypass DNA synthesis" EXACT [GOC:elh]
xref: Reactome:R-HSA-73893 "DNA Damage Bypass"
is_a: GO:0006301 ! DNA damage tolerance
is_a: GO:0090592 ! DNA synthesis involved in DNA replication

