def: "A process in which a protein or protein complex is maintained in a specific location in the cell cortex of a cell tip, and is prevented from moving elsewhere. The cell cortex of a cell tip is the region directly beneath the plasma membrane at either end of the longest axis of a cylindrical or elongated cell." [GOC:al, PMID:19646873]
is_a: GO:0032065 ! maintenance of protein location in cell cortex

